WEBVTT

00:07:29.904 --> 00:07:31.363
there are elections.

00:07:31.405 --> 00:07:35.242
And people can make a difference
by the candidates they support

00:07:35.284 --> 00:07:37.369
and encourage to run.

00:07:37.912 --> 00:07:39.079
JF: Yeah.

00:07:39.663 --> 00:07:43.959
PM: I do think often of your activism

00:07:44.001 --> 00:07:46.128
and how you've sustained it,

00:07:46.170 --> 00:07:49.798
especially when it comes to this issue,
which sometimes feels intractable,

00:07:49.840 --> 00:07:51.467
although we know it isn't.

00:07:51.509 --> 00:07:54.345
But when you hear scientists
say seven years,

00:07:54.345 --> 00:07:57.181
we're this far away, we haven't done this,

00:07:57.181 --> 00:07:59.225
we must do that,

00:07:59.266 --> 00:08:00.809
it's easy to lose hope.